  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Vietnam Partnership for Economic Growth (Aus4Growth)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment aim to close gaps in Vietnam&#x2019;s policy and practice to support enhanced economic growth, trade and investment, clean energy and transport, inclusion, and digital acceleration. 
The investment&#x2019;s objective is to boost trade, investment and inclusion, strengthen the economic partnership, and expand cooperation on climate and energy to contribute to global emission reductions. 
Aus4Growth is designed to support Vietnam&#x2019;s economic growth, and implementation of the Australia Vietnam Enhanced Economic Engagement Strategy and Comprehensive Strategic Partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
